        content:
          "---\nversion: 'alpha'\nname: 'mcoli-ui GameDev'\ndescription: 'Pink Primary with Yellow accents - Vibrant and energetic for gaming.'\ncolors:\n  primary: '#d04f99'\n  primary-foreground: '#ffffff'\n  secondary: '#facc15'\n  secondary-foreground: '#191c1e'\n  accent: '#191c1e'\n  accent-foreground: '#8acfd1'\n  background: '#fdf6e3'\n  foreground: '#2e3133'\n  surface: '#b2e1eb'\n  surface-foreground: '#2e3133'\n  card: '#fbe2a7'\n  card-foreground: '#454749'\n  popover: '#fbe2a7'\n  popover-foreground: '#454749'\n  muted: '#b2e1eb'\n  muted-foreground: '#5d5e61'\n  border: '#d04f99'\n  input: '#e4e4e4'\n  ring: '#e670ab'\n  success: '#22c55e'\n  success-foreground: '#e6f9ee'\n  warning: '#ff6900'\n  warning-foreground: '#fff7ed'\n  destructive: '#f96f70'\n  destructive-foreground: '#ffffff'\n  info: '#007aff'\n  info-foreground: '#ffffff'\n  primary-dark: '#fbe2a7'\n  primary-foreground-dark: '#141c27'\n  secondary-dark: '#e4a2b1'\n  secondary-foreground-dark: '#141c27'\n  accent-dark: '#b4728f'\n  accent-foreground-dark: '#f3e3ea'\n  background-dark: '#141c27'\n  foreground-dark: '#f3e3ea'\n  card-dark: '#121824'\n  card-foreground-dark: '#f3e3ea'\n  muted-dark: '#272e37'\n  muted-foreground-dark: '#e4a2b1'\n  border-dark: '#324859'\n  input-dark: '#20333d'\n  ring-dark: '#50afb6'\ntypography:\n  header-xl:\n    fontFamily: 'Plus Jakarta Sans'\n    fontSize: '72px'\n    lineHeight: '90px'\n    letterSpacing: '-0.02em'\n  header-lg:\n    fontFamily: 'Plus Jakarta Sans'\n    fontSize: '60px'\n    lineHeight: '72px'\n    letterSpacing: '-0.02em'\n  header-md:\n    fontFamily: 'Plus Jakarta Sans'\n    fontSize: '36px'\n    lineHeight: '44px'\n    letterSpacing: '-0.02em'\n  header-sm:\n    fontFamily: 'Plus Jakarta Sans'\n    fontSize: '30px'\n    lineHeight: '38px'\n  header-xs:\n    fontFamily: 'Plus Jakarta Sans'\n    fontSize: '24px'\n    lineHeight: '32px'\n  paragraph-xl:\n    fontFamily: 'DM Sans'\n    fontSize: '20px'\n    lineHeight: '30px'\n  paragraph-lg:\n    fontFamily: 'DM Sans'\n    fontSize: '18px'\n    lineHeight: '28px'\n  paragraph-md:\n    fontFamily: 'DM Sans'\n    fontSize: '16px'\n    lineHeight: '24px'\n  paragraph-sm:\n    fontFamily: 'DM Sans'\n    fontSize: '14px'\n    lineHeight: '20px'\n  paragraph-xs:\n    fontFamily: 'DM Sans'\n    fontSize: '12px'\n    lineHeight: '18px'\n  label-md:\n    fontFamily: 'DM Sans'\n    fontSize: '14px'\n    lineHeight: '20px'\n    fontWeight: 500\n  label-lg:\n    fontFamily: 'DM Sans'\n    fontSize: '16px'\n    lineHeight: '24px'\n    fontWeight: 500\nrounded:\n  sm: '4px'\n  md: '6px'\n  lg: '8px'\n  xl: '12px'\n  2xl: '16px'\n  full: '9999px'\nspacing:\n  xs: '4px'\n  sm: '8px'\n  md: '16px'\n  lg: '24px'\n  xl: '32px'\n  2xl: '48px'\ncomponents:\n  button-primary:\n    backgroundColor: '{colors.primary}'\n    textColor: '{colors.primary-foreground}'\n    typography: '{typography.label-md}'\n    rounded: '{rounded.lg}'\n    padding: '10px 16px'\n  button-primary-hover:\n    backgroundColor: '{colors.secondary-foreground}'\n    textColor: '{colors.secondary}'\n  button-secondary:\n    backgroundColor: '{colors.secondary}'\n    textColor: '{colors.secondary-foreground}'\n    typography: '{typography.label-md}'\n    rounded: '{rounded.lg}'\n    padding: '10px 16px'\n  button-destructive:\n    backgroundColor: '{colors.destructive}'\n    textColor: '{colors.destructive-foreground}'\n    typography: '{typography.label-md}'\n    rounded: '{rounded.lg}'\n    padding: '10px 16px'\n  input:\n    backgroundColor: '{colors.input}'\n    textColor: '{colors.foreground}'\n    typography: '{typography.paragraph-sm}'\n    rounded: '{rounded.lg}'\n  card:\n    backgroundColor: '{colors.card}'\n    textColor: '{colors.card-foreground}'\n    rounded: '{rounded.lg}'\n    padding: '{spacing.md}'\n---\n\n# mcoli-ui GameDev theme\n\n## Overview\n\nPlayful and energetic: hot pink and yellow on a warm cream background. Use it for game jams, gaming community pages and fun announcements.\n\nThis project is built with [mcoli-ui](https://mcoli-ui.microclub.info), Micro Club's component library on top of shadcn/ui and Tailwind CSS v4. The tokens above mirror the CSS variables that `mcoli-ui init --theme game-dev` installed. To refresh this file after a theme change, run `npx mcoli-ui init --theme <name> --overwrite`.\n\n## Colors\n\nPink `primary` drives main actions and also draws `border`s, which gives the theme its outlined, arcade feel. Yellow `secondary` carries supporting actions. Near-black `accent` with teal text makes high-contrast callouts.\n\nEvery token is a Tailwind color: `primary` is `bg-primary`, `text-primary`, `border-primary` and so on. Each surface token has a matching `-foreground` token for the text on top of it; always use them as a pair. `success`, `warning`, `destructive` and `info` are for status only.\n\nDark mode switches the same CSS variables under the `.dark` class, so components need no extra classes. The `-dark` tokens list those values for reference. Never use them as class names.\n\n## Typography\n\nHeadings use Plus Jakarta Sans through the `header-xl` to `header-xs` utilities. Body copy uses DM Sans, the default `body` font, through `paragraph-xl` to `paragraph-xs`. Set weight with Tailwind classes (`font-medium` for labels and buttons, `font-semibold` or `font-bold` for headings). The `label-*` tokens describe button and form-label text.\n\n## Layout\n\nSpacing follows the Tailwind scale (4px steps): `xs` is `1`, `sm` is `2`, `md` is `4`, `lg` is `6`, `xl` is `8` and `2xl` is `12` (for example `p-4`, `gap-6`). Use `gap` on flex and grid containers instead of margins between siblings.\n\n## Elevation & Depth\n\nDepth comes from soft shadows, not borders alone: `shadow-xs`, `shadow-sm`, `shadow-md`, `shadow-lg`, `shadow-xl`, `shadow-2xl`, `shadow-3xl`. Inputs use `shadow-xs`, cards use `shadow-sm`, and popovers, dialogs and menus use `shadow-lg` or higher. Overlays blur the page behind them with `backdrop-blur-sm`.\n\n## Shapes\n\nCorners are soft, and the largest radius (16px) is rounder than in the other themes. Use `rounded-sm` to `rounded-2xl`, which map to the `rounded` tokens, and `rounded-full` only for avatars, dots and pills.\n\n## Components\n\nInstall components with `npx mcoli-ui add <name>` (run `npx mcoli-ui list` to see them all). They land in `components/ui/mc-*.tsx` and already apply these tokens. The `components` tokens describe the main variants: `button-primary`, `button-secondary` and `button-destructive` match `McButton`'s `variant` and `destructive` props, and `input` and `card` match `McInput` and `McCard`.\n\n## Do's and Don'ts\n\n- Do use `mc-*` components before building your own or using plain shadcn/ui primitives.\n- Do use semantic tokens (`bg-primary`, `text-muted-foreground`, `border-border`) instead of palette colors.\n- Do pair every surface token with its `-foreground` token.\n- Do keep the cream `background`; it is part of the identity.\n- Don't hardcode colors, radii or shadows as arbitrary values such as `bg-[#0006b1]` or `rounded-[7px]`.\n- Don't add fonts beyond DM Sans and Plus Jakarta Sans.\n- Don't use `destructive` or `warning` colors for decoration.\n- Don't place yellow `secondary` next to white surfaces without a border; the edge disappears.\n- Don't use white text on `primary` below 18px; the contrast is under 4.5:1.\n",
